  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CEWAS international set up a locally embedded acceleration programme for water, sanitation and WRM enterprises in Kenya, with implementation partner OPERO Services Ltd. The programme seeks to contribute towards a thriving entrepreneurial ecosystem to scale entrepreneurial solutions that ensure the availability and sustainable management of water and sanitation for all. The first cohort of 10 enterprises receives a mix of online and offline coaching and is exposed to various sector players and investors.</narrative>
